- chtrie_walk(tr, from, sym, creat) -> Result<i32, ...> returning child index, or Err when not found and creat==0 (use a distinct error variant/kind for "not found" vs failure).
- chtrie_del(tr, from, sym) -> () (no-op if edge absent).
